fastreindex - Fast Reindex plugin for DokuWiki
==============================================

Refreshes the tag and search index after you edited, added or copied page
files directly (outside of the wiki editor). Unchanged pages are skipped.

Modes
-----
* Tags only (fast): updates the "subject" metadata index used by the tag
  plugin (tag lists, tag links). Only pages that contain {{tag>...}} or have
  subject metadata are processed.
* Full index: runs DokuWiki's own indexer (idx_addPage) for changed pages and
  updates the fulltext search index too. Slower.

Usage
-----
Admin -> Fast Reindex -> Start. Keep the page open until it finishes.
Requires admin rights. The tag plugin is optional (only used to clean tags).

Install
-------
Copy this folder to lib/plugins/fastreindex/ (folder name must be exactly
"fastreindex") or install through the Extension Manager.

